OL,4,BLoneliness & mood swings - what's it   
OL,5,Blike to miss a season through injury?  
OL,6,G"I told my mother. I sat with her and  
OL,7,GI told her: 'Listen, I don't think I   
OL,8,Gcan play any more'," says Dejan        
OL,9,GKulusevski in a moving interview about 
OL,10,Ghis injury nightmare.                  
OL,12,FIt is 18 months since Tottenham and    
OL,13,FSweden winger Kulusevski, 26, last     
OL,14,Fstarted a competitive match.           
